
# faction strength

(0..10) <span style="color: #d42f2f;">a complete failure</span>
(10..30) <span style="color: #FFB74D;">failing to meet the moment</span>
(30..35) <span style="color: #FFD54F;">trying its best</span>
(35..60) <span style="color: #81C784;">taking steps in the right direction</span>
(60..) <span style="color: #66BB6A;">warriors of the people</span>
